2. Windows 11 File-Locking & Parquet Gotchas (Critical)

Windows enforces strict mandatory file locks (unlike Linux, which allows unlinking/renaming open files). Follow these two rules so your multi-process pipeline never crashes with PermissionError: [WinError 32]:
