When kite_ingestor flushes a 60-second Bronze Parquet batch, write to ticks_0915.parquet.tmp in the exact same folder, close the file handle completely, and call os.replace("ticks_0915.parquet.tmp", "ticks_0915.parquet"). os.replace() is guaranteed atomic on both NTFS (Windows) and ext4/XFS (Linux).
2. Never Overwrite Partitioned Parquet Files While Reading:
